  "description": "The VTUVIA SN100 is a powerful all-terrain electric bike built for adventure and reliability. Equipped with a robust 750W brushless motor and torque sensor, this e-bike ensures smooth and responsive performance on various terrains, from city streets to off-road trails.\nIts 48V 14Ah LG-certified battery with UL certification delivers enhanced safety and longevity, offering a maximum range of up to 70 miles on pedal assist. The high-capacity battery is also removable, making it convenient to charge whether at home or on the go.\nDesigned to handle heavy loads, the SN100 supports up to 400 lbs, making it ideal for riders carrying gear or enjoying long-distance rides. The 26\" x 4\" fat tires provide exceptional traction and stability, allowing you to conquer sand, snow, mud, and gravel with ease.\nAdditional features include a durable aluminum alloy frame, 7-speed Shimano drivetrain for versatility, hydraulic disc brakes for reliable stopping power, and a front suspension fork to absorb bumps and enhance comfort.\nThe intuitive LCD keeps you informed with real-time data on speed, battery life, and ride metrics, while the integrated lights ensure visibility during night rides.\n\nWhether you're commuting, exploring rugged paths, or enjoying weekend adventures, the VTUVIA SN100 is built to elevate your riding experience with power, safety, and reliability.",
